{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065125/block/singleImage/3274781/wm/01M81WAVDD2CXKE89E7DZMFBSN.jpeg?updatedAt=1795359705\"/><figcaption>區內客3.28萬元承租SIERRA SEA三房。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>近期整體租賃氣氛正面，入伙盤更備受追捧。中原地產玖瓏山分行經理霍栢雄表示，分行最新錄得西沙 SIERRA SEA 第 2A 期 5 座中層 C 室租務成交，單位實用面積約 647 方呎，三房連套房及儲物房間隔，議價後以 3.28 萬元獲承租，呎租 50.7 元。 霍栢雄透露，新租客為區內客，見屋苑環境舒適，單位價錢合理，即決定租入單位自住。據了解，業主於 2026 年 2 月以 978 萬元買入單位，現享約 4 厘租金回報。 即睇西沙 SIERRA SEA 租盤 (House730)</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.616652+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":275,"images":1,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T07:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T07:57:12.444643+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T08:47:28.658436+00:00","content_hash":"1dc738c1d7d80d79e9886dd3895af60ee23ec47ad9f98e95b48d2e0cb97b9160","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T08:54:08.616652+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}